{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","id":"msg_01DJWGobU4RBEpGpx2Ezv7HC","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good. All the dependencies I need are available:\n- `spring-test` for MockMvc\n- `spring-security-test` for security test support\n- `hamcrest-all` for matchers\n- `json-path` for JSONPath assertions\n\nNow I also note that `json-path-assert` is NOT listed — just `json-path`. The MockMvc integration with jsonPath uses `spring-test` which includes the jsonPath support via `com.jayway.jsonpath`. Actually, Spring MVC Test's `MockMvcResultMatchers.jsonPath()` needs `json-path` on the classpath. We have it — but we might also need `json-path-assert`. Let me check...\n\n\nActually, looking at how Spring 4.x handles this, the standard `.andExpect(jsonPath(\"$.x\").value(...))` style works fine with just `json-path` on the classpath. The `json-path-assert` artifact is only needed if I want to use Hamcrest matchers directly with JSONPath like `.andExpect(jsonPath(\"$.x\", Matchers.is(...)))`, but that's not necessary for basic assertions.\n\nNow I'm moving Item 10 to IN_PROGRESS and implementing the GlobalExceptionHandler. I need to handle six different exception types—MethodArgumentNotValidException for validation errors, NotFoundException for missing resources, DuplicateEmailException for conflicts, BadRequestException for client errors, and a catch-all for any other exceptions—each mapping to the appropriate HTTP status code. All responses will use an ErrorResponse DTO with ISO 8601 timestamps. For testing, I'll set up a standalone MockMvc with a test controller that throws these exceptions, making sure the validator is properly configured so validation errors are captured correctly.\n\nLet me check what fields EmployeeRequest has so I know what to validate in the test.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":6628,"cache_read_input_tokens":45311,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":6628},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6f871528-f57d-4a1c-ae61-fad4f2fa2895","uuid":"5aabbcac-4a0d-452c-a164-d6065455effc"}
